WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
你：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
You: (Don't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:25.501
摄影师。来拍订婚的。
Photographer. For the engagement.

00:00:28.757 --> 00:00:31.557
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:31.757 --> 00:00:34.557
Harland 把订婚提前了。还有十分钟。
Harland moved the engagement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:37.905 --> 00:00:40.205
你：我害的？什么意思？
You: My doing? What do you mean?

00:00:40.305 --> 00:00:43.605
你的气味。全是你。
Your scent. It's all you.

00:00:48.361 --> 00:00:50.661
原来你在这里。
There you are.

00:00:52.361 --> 00:00:55.161
Mate。跟我走。
Mate. Come with me.

00:00:55.509 --> 00:00:57.809
你：Mate？等等，谁要来？
You: Mate? Wait. Who's coming?

00:00:57.909 --> 00:01:01.209
我的族人。还不安全。
My people. Not safe yet.

00:01:06.465 --> 00:01:09.765
现在我身上都是你的气味。
Your scent is on me now.

00:01:09.965 --> 00:01:12.765
到午夜，所有的狼都会知道。
Every wolf will know by midnight.

00:01:13.113 --> 00:01:15.413
你：把手覆在他的拳头上。
You: Lay my hand over his fist.

00:01:15.513 --> 00:01:18.813
别……我可能停不下来。
Don't... I might not stop.

00:01:22.069 --> 00:01:24.869
你的手好暖。
Your hand is warm.

00:01:26.069 --> 00:01:28.369
让他们叫吧。
Let them call.

00:01:30.717 --> 00:01:33.017
你：Selene 是谁？你为什么不接她电话？
You: Who's Selene? Why won't you answer her?

00:01:33.117 --> 00:01:36.417
她是我今晚本该娶的人。
She's who I should marry tonight.

00:01:41.173 --> 00:01:43.473
这是我的领地。
This is my territory.

00:01:43.673 --> 00:01:46.473
在这里，没人能碰你。
No one touches you here.

00:01:48.321 --> 00:01:50.621
你：走进去，直视他的眼睛
You: Step inside and look him in the eye

00:01:50.721 --> 00:01:53.521
看着我。
Look at me.

00:01:58.277 --> 00:02:00.077
是我的气味。会平复的。
It's my scent. It'll settle.

00:02:01.277 --> 00:02:05.577
我不是人。而你，是我从没打算找到的人。
I'm not human. And you're what I never meant to find.

00:02:05.925 --> 00:02:08.225
你：不是人？那你到底是什么？
You: Not human? Then what are you, exactly?

00:02:08.325 --> 00:02:13.125
狼。就是这个词。
Wolf. That's the word.

00:02:14.381 --> 00:02:17.681
我丢下了订婚。
I walked out on the engagement.

00:02:17.881 --> 00:02:20.181
Selene 从来不是我的。
Selene was never mine.

00:02:23.529 --> 00:02:25.829
你：握住他悬在半空的手
You: Take his hovering hand

00:02:25.929 --> 00:02:28.729
你的手好凉。
Your hand is cold.

00:02:31.985 --> 00:02:34.785
你怕吗？告诉我。
Are you afraid? Tell me.

00:02:35.985 --> 00:02:39.285
Alpha，Arkwright 小姐在门前台阶上。
Alpha. Miss Arkwright is on the front steps.

00:02:41.133 --> 00:02:43.433
你：Arkwright 小姐？是 Selene 吗？我要见她。
You: Miss Arkwright? Is that Selene? I want to see her.

00:02:43.533 --> 00:02:48.333
那就去见她。我在。
Then see her. I'm here.

00:02:51.089 --> 00:02:53.889
原来是真的。你就是那个人类。
So it's true. You're the human.

00:02:54.089 --> 00:02:56.889
她不用你操心，Selene。
She is not your concern, Selene.

00:02:58.737 --> 00:03:01.037
你：走到他面前，抚上他的脸
You: Step to him and touch his face

00:03:01.137 --> 00:03:05.937
留下。求你。
Stay. Please.

00:03:09.193 --> 00:03:11.493
你还在发抖。为什么？
You're still shaking. Why?

00:03:13.693 --> 00:03:15.993
今晚留在我身边。
Stay with me tonight.

00:03:16.341 --> 00:03:18.641
你：我留下。但你先告诉我长老的事。
You: I'll stay. But tell me about the elders first.

00:03:18.741 --> 00:03:22.041
留下。好。让长老们来评判。
Stay. Good. The elders judge.

00:03:24.797 --> 00:03:27.597
他们的律法说，人类不能留下。
Their law says no human stays.

00:03:27.797 --> 00:03:30.597
Alpha，Harland 召集了长老。就在今晚。
Alpha. Harland called the elders. Tonight.

00:03:33.945 --> 00:03:36.245
你：挽住他的手臂走进去
You: Take his arm and walk in

00:03:36.345 --> 00:03:41.145
一起。好。
Together. Good.

00:03:42.901 --> 00:03:45.701
那这条律法今晚就作废。
Then the law ends tonight.

00:03:46.901 --> 00:03:49.701
她是我的 Mate。
She is my Mate.

00:03:51.549 --> 00:03:53.849
你：现在怎么办？他们会让我们走出去吗？
You: What happens now? Will they let us walk out?

00:03:53.949 --> 00:03:56.749
他们拦不住我们。
They won't stop us.

00:04:06.005 --> 00:04:08.805
今晚留在我身边。
Stay with me tonight.

00:04:09.153 --> 00:04:11.453
你：我哪儿也不去。走吧。
You: I'm not going anywhere. Let's go.

00:04:11.553 --> 00:04:16.353
好。走吧。
Good. Let's go.

00:04:16.609 --> 00:04:17.909
来。
Come.

00:04:23.109 --> 00:04:26.409
今晚的月亮属于我们。
The moon is ours tonight.

00:04:26.757 --> 00:04:29.057
你：我们要去哪儿？先告诉我。
You: Where are we going? Tell me first.

00:04:29.157 --> 00:04:31.957
去 Arkwright 家。现在。
To the Arkwrights. Now.

00:04:34.213 --> 00:04:37.013
Selene 的父亲召集了长老。
Selene's father called the elders.

00:04:38.213 --> 00:04:41.513
他们要的是她的血，不是我的。
They want her blood. Not mine.

00:04:44.361 --> 00:04:46.661
你：外面是什么？别骗我。
You: What's out there? Don't lie to me.

00:04:46.761 --> 00:04:51.561
是狼。Arkwright 家的。我不骗你。
Wolves. Arkwright's. I won't lie.

00:04:55.317 --> 00:04:59.117
他们在试探我们。你看。
They're testing us. Look.

00:05:01.965 --> 00:05:04.265
你：把手覆上他的手
You: Cover his hand with mine

00:05:04.365 --> 00:05:09.165
你的手。跟紧我。
Your hand. Stay close.

00:05:10.421 --> 00:05:13.721
我来拦住他们。别开门。
I'll hold them off. Don't open the door.

00:05:15.921 --> 00:05:19.221
待在车里。我就在这儿。
Stay in the car. I'll be right here.

00:05:19.569 --> 00:05:21.869
你：别想把我留在这儿。我要出去。
You: Don't you dare leave me in here. I'm coming out.

00:05:21.969 --> 00:05:25.269
那就跟紧我。
Then stay close to me.

00:05:28.525 --> 00:05:31.825
你看。他们不会再靠近了。
Look. They won't come closer.

00:05:33.525 --> 00:05:36.825
只要你在我身边，就不会。
Not while you're beside me.
